msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Depannage"

#: ../../docs/tools/visual-algorithm-designer/operations.md:13
#: f91f72dc22bb4727b56f0987b4170001
msgid "Confirm the repository and branch."
msgstr "Confirmez le depot et la branche."

#: ../../docs/tools/visual-algorithm-designer/operations.md:14
#: 320258b50d914169a9b6875468da7264
msgid "Reproduce with the smallest supported input."
msgstr "Reproduisez avec la plus petite entree prise en charge."

#: ../../docs/tools/visual-algorithm-designer/operations.md:15
#: 28767ba60f0644cebf4a7d798820680c
msgid "Capture the exact command and error."
msgstr "Consignez la commande et l'erreur exactes."

#: ../../docs/tools/visual-algorithm-designer/operations.md:16
#: 686682441fe441b8a0600bdf7d10a6a2
msgid "Check the documented runtime and lockfile."
msgstr "Verifiez le runtime documente et le fichier de verrouillage."

#: ../../docs/tools/visual-algorithm-designer/operations.md:17
#: d1922ef92d77468988cc75fc6cf492bb
msgid "Open an issue with secret-free evidence."
msgstr "Ouvrez une issue avec des preuves sans secret."

#: ../../docs/tools/visual-algorithm-designer/operations.md:19
#: 0fd3ad19f77e438daf13b8ba8cf99abc
msgid "Security and privacy"
msgstr "Securite et vie privee"

#: ../../docs/tools/visual-algorithm-designer/operations.md:21
#: d4fd8f61c3e34ec5af2e63d94043cd52
msgid ""
"Visual composition does not guarantee algorithmic correctness; tests and "
"code review remain required."
msgstr ""
"La composition visuelle ne garantit pas la correction algorithmique; les "
"tests et la revue de code restent obligatoires."

#: ../../docs/tools/visual-algorithm-designer/operations.md:23
#: fc415b34f1bc4337b6ab826c84a0387d
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "Contribuer"

#: ../../docs/tools/visual-algorithm-designer/operations.md:25
#: 09fcd65c087e44e68af8edf4584be974
msgid ""
"Read `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `SAFETY.md`, and the repository "
"license when present. Keep changes bounded and include the checks that "
"justify acceptance."
msgstr ""
"Lisez `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `SAFETY.md` et la licence du depot "
"lorsqu'ils existent. Gardez les changements bornes et incluez les controles "
"qui justifient leur acceptation."

#: ../../docs/tools/visual-algorithm-designer/operations.md:27
